{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/28e1c439c632663d323d0edc004b9d3b.avif?t=1773729270\" width=900 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/c2e271b9e305eff60a7d711ec17d64b0.webp?t=1773729270\" width=900 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u201dMy Eerie Lair\u201d</strong> is a <strong>relaxing, gridless furnishing game </strong>set inside a<strong> vampire\u2019s sprawling castle. </strong>Tap into the twisted joy of making something darkly beautiful with<strong> no management, no penalty, and plenty of customization. </strong>Uncover the dark story that binds Victor, the vampire, and his captive bride-to-be, Mary, as you unlock new objects and furnish the castle's rooms. Alternatively, simply kick back in <strong>Sandbox\u00a0Mode</strong> and design the chambers purely for the joy of creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/e8fb5ac3cd61738d4cabbb7c409380fe.webp?t=1773729270\" width=900 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/4d2900c1c7f0afa163d43790b7147c69.poster.avif?t=1773729270\" width=900 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/4d2900c1c7f0afa163d43790b7147c69.webm?t=1773729270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/efc866d5a77e214956b16ec20bce56e9.webp?t=1773729270\" width=900 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/c803731dde5804bdcb3cd1b64d042826.avif?t=1773729270\" width=900 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/c2e271b9e305eff60a7d711ec17d64b0.webp?t=1773729270\" width=900 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the castle's rooms, you'll encounter the <strong>Gloomlings</strong>: Victor's hooded servants. They are lazy and uncooperative. <strong>Interact with them</strong> to force them to work. They will unlock <strong>magical chests</strong> for you, from which you can choose new objects to furnish the chambers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/e8fb5ac3cd61738d4cabbb7c409380fe.webp?t=1773729270\" width=900 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/0cae3fea1b6094fdfe403cf8fba6f18f.poster.avif?t=1773729270\" width=900 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/0cae3fea1b6094fdfe403cf8fba6f18f.webm?t=1773729270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/0cae3fea1b6094fdfe403cf8fba6f18f.mp4?t=1773729270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/20484f16c6856f1e9a8365bc15fa891c.webp?t=1773729270\" width=900 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/6e3a57119042d24444bb466231120da6.avif?t=1773729270\" width=900 height=330 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/c2e271b9e305eff60a7d711ec17d64b0.webp?t=1773729270\" width=900 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unlock and furnish</strong> the entire castle by progressing through the <strong>Story Mode</strong> and fill the rooms with <strong>thousands of objects</strong> as the twisted relationship between Victor and Mary evolves. <strong>Experiment</strong> and create distinct moods by freely manipulating the <strong>color, scale, and rotation</strong> of the furnishings. <strong>Set the lighting</strong> by choosing from hundreds of <strong>color palettes</strong>, creating ambiences that span from the <strong>grim and seductive</strong> to the <strong>dreamy and melancholic.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/e8fb5ac3cd61738d4cabbb7c409380fe.webp?t=1773729270\" width=900 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/592e7fbbd2e281c968845d5e46b3614f.poster.avif?t=1773729270\" width=900 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621690/extras/592e7fbbd2e281c968845d5e46b3614f.webm?t=1773729270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><im